WEEK 2 — SYSTEM DESIGN AND ARCHITECTURE

Date: Monday, 17 August 2026

Problem: The phone calculated the amount and sent it to the server, so anyone could edit it and pay Rs. 1 for a Rs. 3,000 shirt.

Solution:
- Moved all pricing to the server.
- The app now sends only the barcode and the quantity.
- The server looks up price and GST and creates the payment order.
- Made this the main rule: clients send intents, never amounts.
- Made the payment methods extend Checkout and signature verification include Pay online.
